{"seq":2,"slug":"consumer-behavior","title":"大学工商管理 — 消费者行为","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/consumer-behavior","wordCount":2229,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学工商管理-消费者行为\">大学工商管理 — 消费者行为</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>消费者行为学（Consumer Behavior）研究个体、群体和组织如何选择、购买、使用和处置产品与服务来满足需求，以及这些过程中的心理活动和社会互动。这门学科融合了心理学、社会学、经济学和人类学的理论工具，为营销策略设计提供微观层面的行为洞察。</p>\n<p>消费者行为研究的价值在于：消费者的购买决策远非理性经济人假设所描述的那样简单。行为经济学的大量实验表明，人的决策系统性地偏离理性——受到框架效应、锚定效应、损失厌恶和社会规范等多种因素的影响。理解这些&quot;非理性&quot;的规律性，是有效营销的知识基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"消费者决策过程\">消费者决策过程</h3><p>经典的五阶段购买决策模型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[需求识别] --&gt; B[信息搜索]&#10;    B --&gt; C[方案评估]&#10;    C --&gt; D[购买决策]&#10;    D --&gt; E[购后行为]\">graph LR\n    A[需求识别] --&gt; B[信息搜索]\n    B --&gt; C[方案评估]\n    C --&gt; D[购买决策]\n    D --&gt; E[购后行为]</pre><p><strong>需求识别</strong>：内部刺激（饥饿、口渴）或外部刺激（广告、同伴推荐）触发对现实状态与理想状态之间差距的感知。营销者通过广告创造&quot;理想状态&quot;来激发需求——护肤品广告展示完美肌肤，激发消费者对当前状态的不满。</p>\n<p><strong>信息搜索</strong>：消费者的信息来源分为个人来源（家人、朋友，影响力最大）、商业来源（广告、推销员，信息量最大）、公共来源（媒体评测、消费者报告）和经验来源（亲自试用）。搜索强度与感知风险成正比——购买一瓶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 的水几乎不搜索，购买一台 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥100,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 的汽车可能搜索数周。互联网大幅降低了搜索成本，使消费者搜索行为更加广泛，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">88\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">88%</span></span></span></span></span> 的消费者在线下购买前会先进行在线搜索。</p>\n<p><strong>方案评估</strong>：消费者根据产品属性赋予不同权重进行评估。多属性态度模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_j = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot b_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为对品牌 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的总体态度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为属性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为品牌 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 在属性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 上的评分。例如消费者评估手机时，如果将摄像头权重设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.35</span></span></span></span></span>、性能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span>、价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span>、外观 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span></span></span></span></span>，则各品牌的加权总分决定偏好排序。</p>\n<p><strong>购买决策</strong>：从偏好到实际购买之间可能被两个因素干扰——他人态度（重要他人的反对意见）和意外情境因素（突然失业、竞品降价）。冲动购买（Impulse Buying）跳过了方案评估阶段，在零售环境中占购买行为的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%\\text{-}60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>购后行为</strong>：满意度决定重复购买和口碑传播。不满意的消费者中只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4%</span></span></span></span></span> 会直接投诉，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>91</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">91\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">91%</span></span></span></span></span> 不再购买，平均向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9\\text{-}15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 人传播负面体验（社交媒体时代这一数字可放大数百倍）。<strong>认知失调</strong>（Cognitive Dissonance）在高价购买后尤为常见——消费者购买贵重商品后会选择性关注支持自己选择的信息、回避竞品优势信息，以减少决策后的不安感。</p>\n<h3 id=\"影响消费者行为的因素\">影响消费者行为的因素</h3><p><strong>文化因素</strong>是影响消费行为最深层的力量。文化价值观决定了消费者对什么是&quot;好的&quot;和&quot;值得追求的&quot;的基本判断。霍夫斯泰德的文化维度框架表明，高集体主义文化（如中国）中消费决策更受参照群体影响，而高个人主义文化（如美国）中消费者更依赖自我判断。亚文化（如 Z 世代、二次元社群）和社会阶层进一步细化了文化对消费的影响。</p>\n<p><strong>社会因素</strong>：参照群体（Reference Group）对消费行为的影响通过三种机制实现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>影响类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>消费示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信息性影响</td>\n<td>向群体成员获取产品信息</td>\n<td>请教朋友哪款笔记本好用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规范性影响</td>\n<td>遵守群体消费规范以获得认同</td>\n<td>办公室同事都穿正装，自己也穿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价值表达性影响</td>\n<td>通过消费表达群体身份认同</td>\n<td>购买环保品牌表达价值观</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>意见领袖</strong>（Key Opinion Leader, KOL）在信息性影响中发挥放大效应。社交媒体时代 KOL 营销已成为品牌传播的重要渠道——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 的年轻消费者表示 KOL 推荐会影响其购买决策。</p>\n<p><strong>心理因素</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>知觉的选择性</strong>：消费者每天接触 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6000</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6000\\text{-}10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span> 条广告信息，但有意识注意到的不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 条。选择性注意（只关注与自身需求相关的信息）、选择性扭曲（按已有态度解读信息）和选择性保留（只记住支持自身观点的信息）构成了信息处理的三道过滤器。营销者必须突破第一道过滤器——利用新奇性、对比度和个人相关性吸引注意力。</p>\n<p><strong>学习与记忆</strong>：消费者通过经典条件反射（品牌与愉悦体验反复配对）和操作性条件反射（购买后获得奖励强化重复购买）学习品牌偏好。记忆中的品牌联想网络（Associative Network）决定了品牌在消费者心智中的位置——可口可乐的联想网络节点包括&quot;红色&quot;&quot;快乐&quot;&quot;夏天&quot;&quot;美国文化&quot;等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"行为经济学视角\">行为经济学视角</h3><p>传统经济学假设消费者是理性的效用最大化者，但行为经济学揭示了系统性的偏离：</p>\n<p><strong>锚定效应</strong>：先呈现的数字会影响后续判断。在商店中将原价标签（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>999</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥999</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">999</span></span></span></span></span>）和折扣价（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>599</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥599</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">599</span></span></span></span></span>）同时展示，原价成为&quot;锚&quot;，使消费者认为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>599</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥599</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">599</span></span></span></span></span> 非常划算。实验显示，即使消费者知道锚点不相关，锚定效应仍然存在。</p>\n<p><strong>损失厌恶</strong>：损失带来的负效用约为同等收益正效用的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span>，Kahneman &amp; Tversky）。营销应用：免费试用（让消费者先&quot;拥有&quot;，退还需承受&quot;损失&quot;感）、限时优惠（错过即&quot;损失&quot;折扣）。</p>\n<p><strong>默认效应</strong>：人们倾向于接受默认选项。在订阅服务中，将&quot;自动续费&quot;设为默认选项的续订率比需要主动勾选的高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%\\text{-}80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>选择过载</strong>：选项过多反而降低购买意愿。经典的果酱实验中，展示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 种果酱的摊位吸引了更多浏览者，但购买率仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span></span></span></span></span>；展示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 种果酱的摊位购买率达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>心理账户</strong>（Mental Accounting）：消费者将金钱分配到不同的心理账户（日常开支、娱乐、教育），各账户的边际消费倾向不同。赢得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 的彩票更可能被花在享乐消费上，而节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 的购物折扣更可能用于日常必需品——同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>，因来源不同而被分配到不同的心理账户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>回忆你最近一次超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 的购物经历，用五阶段决策模型逐步分析你的决策过程。是否出现了认知失调？你如何缓解的？</li>\n<li>分析&quot;直播带货&quot;现象中，哪些心理学原理在发挥作用？（提示：考虑从众效应、稀缺性、时间压力、信任转移等）</li>\n<li>为什么星巴克菜单上有一款很少人点的超大杯高价饮品？从锚定效应的角度分析其菜单定价策略。</li>\n<li>设计一个消费者调研方案：某新茶饮品牌想了解目标消费者（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18\\text{-}30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 岁都市白领）的购买动机和品牌偏好。确定调研方法、样本量和关键问题。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>阅读丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》了解系统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（直觉）和系统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>（理性）的双加工理论</li>\n<li>研究<strong>神经营销学</strong>（Neuromarketing）——fMRI 和 EEG 如何揭示消费者的无意识偏好</li>\n<li>了解<strong>可持续消费行为</strong>研究——为什么消费者的环保态度与实际购买行为之间存在&quot;绿色鸿沟&quot;</li>\n<li>探索<strong>算法推荐</strong>对消费者行为的影响——个性化推荐是帮助决策还是操纵选择？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>消费者行为学为营销实践提供了深层的行为洞察。从理性的五阶段决策模型到行为经济学揭示的系统性偏差，从文化和社会因素的深层影响到心理账户的微妙运作，消费者行为的复杂性远超表面认知。理解消费者&quot;如何&quot;决策以及&quot;为什么&quot;如此决策，是制定有效营销策略、创建有意义的品牌连接和设计卓越消费体验的知识基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学工商管理 — 消费者行为","id":"大学工商管理-消费者行为"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"消费者决策过程","id":"消费者决策过程"},{"level":3,"text":"影响消费者行为的因素","id":"影响消费者行为的因素"},{"level":3,"text":"行为经济学视角","id":"行为经济学视角"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学工商管理 — 市场营销原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/marketing-principles"},"next":{"title":"大学工商管理 — 数字营销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/digital-marketing"}}